1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:02:25,760 --> 00:02:26,810
Father...

25
00:02:33,910 --> 00:02:36,340
Noooo !!!

26
00:03:25,990 --> 00:03:27,830
It's time for dinner.

27
00:03:28,120 --> 00:03:30,030
Hurry, let's eat.

28
00:03:40,750 --> 00:03:41,680
Father,

29
00:03:41,920 --> 00:03:42,870
Mother,

30
00:03:43,200 --> 00:03:45,160
I miss you so much...

31
00:03:45,480 --> 00:03:46,560
so much...

32
00:03:53,830 --> 00:03:55,490
I didn't expect

33
00:03:55,520 --> 00:03:57,230
that I would be able

34
00:03:57,920 --> 00:04:00,850
to condense my killing intent even further.

35
00:04:00,600 --> 00:04:03,310
My state of heart wasn't right before.

36
00:04:19,940 --> 00:04:22,150
Ceng Da Niu

37
00:04:21,080 --> 00:04:22,150
Woaaa !

38
00:04:27,910 --> 00:04:29,500
Did Uncle make this ?

39
00:04:29,270 --> 00:04:30,520
So cool.

40
00:04:31,470 --> 00:04:32,510
What's the matter ?

41
00:04:32,520 --> 00:04:33,550
Oh, right.

42
00:04:34,110 --> 00:04:35,680
I came to give you this.

43
00:04:48,960 --> 00:04:50,430
Now when a guest comes in,

44
00:04:50,190 --> 00:04:51,390
you will know.

45
00:04:54,630 --> 00:04:55,800
This is for you.

46
00:04:59,750 --> 00:05:01,120
Thank you Uncle !

47
00:05:02,550 --> 00:05:03,450
Uncle,

48
00:05:03,360 --> 00:05:04,600
my name is Da Niu.

49
00:05:04,510 --> 00:05:06,470
I'm from the blacksmith across the street.

50
00:05:06,760 --> 00:05:08,240
Remember to come and play with me.

51
00:05:14,010 --> 00:05:16,360
Ceng Niu
Ceng Da Niu's father

52
00:05:12,230 --> 00:05:13,800
Dad, Mom !

53
00:05:13,880 --> 00:05:15,170
Look at this !

54
00:05:14,920 --> 00:05:16,790
The uncle across the street gave it to me.

55
00:05:14,010 --> 00:05:16,360
Ceng Si
Ceng Da Niu's mother

56
00:05:17,280 --> 00:05:18,630
Here, let me see.

57
00:05:21,680 --> 00:05:23,190
Such an exquisite wood carving !

58
00:05:25,600 --> 00:05:27,670
You little ignorant rascal !

59
00:05:28,440 --> 00:05:29,520
Ouch, it hurts.

60
00:05:33,540 --> 00:05:34,330
Brother,

61
00:05:34,710 --> 00:05:35,800
excuse him.

62
00:05:35,560 --> 00:05:37,010
The kid doesn't understand.

63
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:38,370
How much does it cost ?

64
00:05:39,160 --> 00:05:40,560
I gifted it to him,

65
00:05:40,350 --> 00:05:42,260
it's just a piece of wood after all.

66
00:05:48,950 --> 00:05:50,510
You just arrived, right ?

67
00:05:50,640 --> 00:05:53,440
The shop across the street has been empty for years.

68
00:05:53,790 --> 00:05:54,840
Brother,

69
00:05:54,720 --> 00:05:56,030
if you don't mind,

70
00:05:56,070 --> 00:05:57,520
come over for a meal.

71
00:05:58,160 --> 00:06:00,000
I have homemade wine.

72
00:06:00,190 --> 00:06:02,330
It's much better than the wine in restaurants !

73
00:06:04,400 --> 00:06:05,430
Okay.

74
00:06:05,590 --> 00:06:06,310
Thank you.

75
00:06:06,720 --> 00:06:08,310
You're welcome.

76
00:06:08,380 --> 00:06:10,710
We'll be neighbors from now on.

77
00:06:11,320 --> 00:06:12,070
Let's go !

78
00:06:11,820 --> 00:06:13,250
I'll show you around.

79
00:06:21,360 --> 00:06:23,400
How long has it been since I last ate ?

80
00:06:24,030 --> 00:06:26,470
I stopped eating at Foundation Establishment.

81
00:06:29,550 --> 00:06:32,080
Does it not suit your taste ?

82
00:06:32,640 --> 00:06:33,560
Brother,

83
00:06:33,760 --> 00:06:35,530
We only have this simple food.

84
00:06:35,390 --> 00:06:36,440
I'm sorry.

85
00:06:37,040 --> 00:06:38,110
I like it.

86
00:06:41,240 --> 00:06:42,950
Come on, eat this.

87
00:06:43,670 --> 00:06:45,090
Since you just arrived here,

88
00:06:44,840 --> 00:06:46,310
you aren't familiar with this place.

89
00:06:46,070 --> 00:06:47,360
If you need anything,

90
00:06:47,120 --> 00:06:48,480
let us know.

91
00:06:48,880 --> 00:06:50,840
As neighbours, we should help each other.

92
00:06:51,270 --> 00:06:52,710
If you need groceries,

93
00:06:52,600 --> 00:06:54,170
go to the Li Family's shop,

94
00:06:54,310 --> 00:06:56,390
it's good and affordable.

95
00:06:58,110 --> 00:07:00,430
The Xu Family's shop is expensive

96
00:07:00,590 --> 00:07:02,310
but the people are kind.

97
00:07:02,670 --> 00:07:05,390
I heard that their young master is very successful.

98
00:07:05,590 --> 00:07:07,090
He's following the Crown Prince.

99
00:07:08,500 --> 00:07:10,990
The craft of brewing wine is passed down in our family.

100
00:07:10,900 --> 00:07:11,840
Try it.

101
00:07:17,300 --> 00:07:18,330
It's a good wine !

102
00:07:19,560 --> 00:07:20,750
Come on, one more.

103
00:07:22,520 --> 00:07:24,810
Come on, eat more. Cheers.

104
00:07:25,790 --> 00:07:30,530
1 year later

105
00:07:35,560 --> 00:07:36,800
Uncle Wang,

106
00:07:36,560 --> 00:07:38,190
what kind of animal is this ?

107
00:07:38,560 --> 00:07:40,210
It looks like a turtle

108
00:07:40,310 --> 00:07:41,840
but its head is weird.

109
00:08:12,910 --> 00:08:14,930
It's a kind of ancient creature.

110
00:08:15,160 --> 00:08:16,840
Although it looks like this,

111
00:08:17,510 --> 00:08:19,210
in reality it's fierce

112
00:08:19,200 --> 00:08:20,610
and powerful.

113
00:08:22,300 --> 00:08:24,190
It sounds so cool !

114
00:08:26,490 --> 00:08:30,990
10 days later

115
00:08:31,910 --> 00:08:32,910
Uncle Wang,

116
00:08:32,830 --> 00:08:34,250
I'm here to deliver the wine.

117
00:09:08,110 --> 00:09:09,370
This is a fire spider.

118
00:09:09,720 --> 00:09:11,290
It has a violent temperament

119
00:09:11,120 --> 00:09:12,930
and its 8 legs are very sharp.

120
00:09:13,070 --> 00:09:14,610
Don't get hurt by one.

121
00:09:15,160 --> 00:09:16,810
This is so interesting !

122
00:09:17,950 --> 00:09:18,960
Dad !

123
00:09:18,800 --> 00:09:20,480
I don't want to be a blacksmith.

124
00:09:20,280 --> 00:09:22,050
I want to learn wood carving !

125
00:09:21,880 --> 00:09:23,240
What the hell are you talking about ?

126
00:09:23,240 --> 00:09:25,400
You cannot even hold a forge hammer properly,

127
00:09:25,190 --> 00:09:27,190
yet you want to do fine work like Uncle Wang ?

128
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:28,510
You little rascal !

129
00:09:28,350 --> 00:09:29,870
Ouch !

130
00:09:37,720 --> 00:09:39,010
Like a breeze,

131
00:09:39,390 --> 00:09:42,050
4 seasons have already gone by.

132
00:09:42,880 --> 00:09:44,610
Because my cultivation is limited,

133
00:09:44,400 --> 00:09:47,240
I cannot carve Soul Formation cultivators.

134
00:09:47,560 --> 00:09:48,890
But it doesn't matter,

135
00:09:48,920 --> 00:09:50,080
the journey is long.

136
00:09:50,800 --> 00:09:52,910
I carved my memories,

137
00:09:53,240 --> 00:09:54,850
the villagers of the Wang Family,

138
00:09:54,820 --> 00:09:56,560
Spirit Beasts I have faced.

139
00:09:57,280 --> 00:09:59,170
They seem to have been reborn

140
00:09:59,400 --> 00:10:01,270
when I carve them this way.

141
00:10:11,360 --> 00:10:13,570
When I condense a fourth bead,

142
00:10:14,200 --> 00:10:16,290
the killing intent will disappear.

143
00:10:18,510 --> 00:10:19,650
Look at this !

144
00:10:20,320 --> 00:10:21,820
It's a great wood carving.

145
00:10:21,580 --> 00:10:22,400
Indeed !

146
00:10:22,160 --> 00:10:23,560
It's really good.

147
00:10:25,760 --> 00:10:26,910
Not bad...

148
00:10:28,440 --> 00:10:29,600
It's like a real one.

149
00:10:29,360 --> 00:10:30,110
Look at this one !

150
00:10:30,600 --> 00:10:31,840
Let's look at this one.

151
00:10:32,110 --> 00:10:33,880
Everyone praises how good they are,

152
00:10:33,870 --> 00:10:35,870
but no one buys them.

153
00:10:52,120 --> 00:10:53,990
Master Xu is coming back.

154
00:10:53,840 --> 00:10:55,300
Master Xu follows the Crown Prince

155
00:10:55,080 --> 00:10:56,630
he's a great man now !

156
00:10:59,080 --> 00:11:00,340
Come, have a look !

157
00:10:59,740 --> 00:11:00,750
Da Niu,

158
00:11:00,680 --> 00:11:02,240
let go of me, okay ?

159
00:11:03,160 --> 00:11:04,110
Master Xu,

160
00:11:04,080 --> 00:11:05,480
look at these wood carvings.

161
00:11:05,240 --> 00:11:07,150
They are better than those of the Zhou Family.

162
00:11:07,040 --> 00:11:08,790
So... Will you buy one ?

163
00:11:09,020 --> 00:11:11,270
Xu Tao

164
00:11:12,300 --> 00:11:14,050
Don't sell it too expensive.

165
00:11:33,280 --> 00:11:34,980
When you touch these wood carvings,

166
00:11:34,740 --> 00:11:36,810
it feels strange right ?

167
00:11:36,560 --> 00:11:38,570
I usually just look at them.

168
00:11:39,540 --> 00:11:40,490
I'm sorry.

169
00:11:41,920 --> 00:11:42,940
It's okay.

170
00:11:43,100 --> 00:11:46,110
Sir, what kind of animal is it ?

171
00:11:46,250 --> 00:11:48,270
Why does it look like a snake to me ?

172
00:11:48,030 --> 00:11:49,360
This is a Flood Dragon !

173
00:11:49,270 --> 00:11:51,200
It's an immortal creature !

174
00:11:51,910 --> 00:11:53,170
A Flood Dragon ?

175
00:11:53,800 --> 00:11:55,640
How much does this carving cost ?

176
00:11:57,470 --> 00:11:58,680
10 taels of gold.

177
00:12:01,640 --> 00:12:03,010
No...

178
00:12:02,760 --> 00:12:04,970
it's so over...

179
00:12:05,150 --> 00:12:06,330
Thank you, sir.

180
00:12:06,430 --> 00:12:07,760
I want this wood carving.

181
00:12:09,910 --> 00:12:10,970
Goodbye.

182
00:12:11,720 --> 00:12:14,910
10 taels of gold ?

183
00:12:19,590 --> 00:12:21,430
His Highness loves beautiful carvings.

184
00:12:21,580 --> 00:12:23,240
The Crown Prince is principled,

185
00:12:23,550 --> 00:12:25,520
if I give him this carving

186
00:12:25,400 --> 00:12:27,430
he will praise me for sure.

187
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:30,270
Your Highness,

188
00:12:30,040 --> 00:12:31,800
Xu Tao wants to see you.

189
00:12:33,400 --> 00:12:34,950
Thank you, your Highness.

190
00:12:35,160 --> 00:12:36,700
What's going on ?

191
00:12:36,480 --> 00:12:37,700
We can talk tomorrow.

192
00:12:37,480 --> 00:12:38,750
Your Highness,

193
00:12:39,440 --> 00:12:42,450
I found a wood carving I think you will like.

194
00:12:42,560 --> 00:12:44,530
If his Highness sees it,

195
00:12:44,280 --> 00:12:45,510
he will understand.

196
00:12:51,820 --> 00:12:54,940
Crown Prince
8th layer of Qi Condensation

197
00:12:58,000 --> 00:12:59,580
Your Highness, don't touch it !

198
00:13:04,820 --> 00:13:06,000
This is a treasure.

199
00:13:06,470 --> 00:13:07,720
You have done a great service !

200
00:13:11,380 --> 00:13:12,610
Let's go.

201
00:13:12,350 --> 00:13:14,000
Come with me to see my father.

202
00:13:25,180 --> 00:13:27,120
Mortal King

203
00:13:27,120 --> 00:13:28,670
Zhou Qiao
White Could Sect disciple
Late stage Foundation Establishment

204
00:13:28,490 --> 00:13:29,960
Weng Qi
White Cloud Sect disciple
Early stage Core Formation

205
00:13:35,600 --> 00:13:37,170
Why did you come to see me ?

206
00:13:36,920 --> 00:13:38,570
Weren't you having fun ?

207
00:13:40,960 --> 00:13:42,790
Father, look.

208
00:13:48,240 --> 00:13:49,310
This is...

209
00:13:50,070 --> 00:13:51,590
This is a wood carving.

210
00:13:51,360 --> 00:13:53,960
Senior Brother, of course I know this is a wood carving !

211
00:13:53,860 --> 00:13:56,400
I mean, what is this a carving of ?

212
00:13:57,520 --> 00:13:59,010
I haven't seen it before.

213
00:13:59,540 --> 00:14:00,680
Immortal Elders,

214
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:03,910
is there anything special about this carving ?

215
00:14:08,190 --> 00:14:09,400
This wood carving...

216
00:14:09,350 --> 00:14:10,980
the higher your cultivation

217
00:14:10,750 --> 00:14:12,410
the more you are affected by it.

218
00:14:12,190 --> 00:14:13,440
But for mortals,

219
00:14:13,200 --> 00:14:14,760
the effect is small.

220
00:14:14,520 --> 00:14:15,700
This object

221
00:14:15,480 --> 00:14:17,560
is not a normal carving.

222
00:14:17,470 --> 00:14:19,410
The creature that is carved is almost the same

223
00:14:19,160 --> 00:14:22,450
as the Flood Dragon in the ancient records of our sect.

224
00:14:22,310 --> 00:14:24,770
But you said you had not seen it before...

225
00:14:25,830 --> 00:14:27,180
It doesn't mean

226
00:14:27,110 --> 00:14:29,250
that I didn't recognize it.

227
00:14:30,600 --> 00:14:31,780
This means...

228
00:14:31,750 --> 00:14:33,820
this object is a real treasure !

229
00:14:33,710 --> 00:14:34,630
Guards,

230
00:14:34,680 --> 00:14:37,840
Reward the Crown Prince with gold, silver and jade.

231
00:14:38,960 --> 00:14:40,330
Your Highness,

232
00:14:40,080 --> 00:14:41,530
where did you

233
00:14:41,560 --> 00:14:43,560
find this wood carving ?

234
00:15:02,110 --> 00:15:03,010
This...

235
00:15:02,760 --> 00:15:05,020
So many treasures...

236
00:15:05,240 --> 00:15:06,400
We're rich !

237
00:15:06,230 --> 00:15:07,360
Junior Brother,

238
00:15:07,120 --> 00:15:08,760
we're rich !

239
00:15:12,140 --> 00:15:13,200
What ?!

240
00:15:25,080 --> 00:15:26,120
Senior Brother,

241
00:15:26,280 --> 00:15:28,330
this place is terrifying.

242
00:15:29,520 --> 00:15:30,880
The greater the risk,

243
00:15:30,640 --> 00:15:31,900
the greater the gains.

244
00:15:32,160 --> 00:15:33,000
Come on.

245
00:15:52,520 --> 00:15:54,750
Teleportation !?

246
00:15:56,590 --> 00:15:57,290
This...

247
00:15:57,040 --> 00:15:59,050
Why is a Nascent Soul cultivator here !?

248
00:16:00,030 --> 00:16:02,010
You dared provoke the fiend,

249
00:16:01,840 --> 00:16:03,720
you're doomed !

250
00:16:03,680 --> 00:16:06,670
And I am the one who will devour your souls !

251
00:16:06,550 --> 00:16:07,320
Dead...

252
00:16:07,740 --> 00:16:08,870
We're so dead...

253
00:16:23,240 --> 00:16:25,270
That will be a total of 4500 taels of gold.

254
00:16:25,390 --> 00:16:26,440
Pay up.

255
00:16:30,080 --> 00:16:31,650
Paying respects to Senior,

256
00:16:31,470 --> 00:16:33,490
Juniors are disciples of the White Cloud Sect.

257
00:16:33,300 --> 00:16:35,690
We didn't know these carvings were Senior's.

258
00:16:35,950 --> 00:16:37,420
We are sorry for what we did,

259
00:16:37,320 --> 00:16:39,220
please forgive us.

260
00:16:40,760 --> 00:16:42,320
4500 taels of gold...

261
00:16:42,740 --> 00:16:43,990
Do you have enough ?

262
00:16:46,520 --> 00:16:47,530
Senior,

263
00:16:47,630 --> 00:16:49,790
I have some spirit stones.

264
00:16:49,830 --> 00:16:52,370
I don't have the gold mortals use.

265
00:17:03,070 --> 00:17:04,320
He won't kill them ?

266
00:17:04,080 --> 00:17:05,830
How unfortunate...

267
00:17:05,990 --> 00:17:07,150
Get out.

268
00:17:07,240 --> 00:17:08,280
Next time,

269
00:17:08,720 --> 00:17:09,950
bring enough money.

270
00:17:11,100 --> 00:17:12,350
Wait for me !

271
00:17:22,640 --> 00:17:24,240
The killing intent is gone.

272
00:17:29,600 --> 00:17:31,170
The Spring Festival is coming.

273
00:17:31,030 --> 00:17:33,610
This is a token of goodwill from the Crown Prince.

274
00:17:33,680 --> 00:17:35,000
His Highness said,

275
00:17:34,880 --> 00:17:37,190
that if Master Immortal needs help in the future,

276
00:17:37,190 --> 00:17:39,590
he's more than willing to help you out.

277
00:17:48,950 --> 00:17:50,040
Happy New Year !

278
00:17:49,960 --> 00:17:51,300
Happy New Year !

279
00:18:00,440 --> 00:18:02,350
Happy New Year Brother Liu !

280
00:18:02,480 --> 00:18:04,060
Happy New Year !

281
00:18:03,830 --> 00:18:05,590
It's New Year already !

282
00:18:17,680 --> 00:18:18,760
Uncle Wang,

283
00:18:18,720 --> 00:18:21,360
why have I never seen these carvings before ?

284
00:18:21,280 --> 00:18:22,960
Are they new ?

285
00:18:25,390 --> 00:18:27,210
They are the first I made,

286
00:18:27,080 --> 00:18:28,480
these carvings...

287
00:18:28,420 --> 00:18:29,690
are my family.

288
00:18:40,680 --> 00:18:41,760
Uncle Wang,

289
00:18:41,840 --> 00:18:43,530
my father told me

290
00:18:43,280 --> 00:18:46,030
that shopkeeper Lu tried to marry his daughter to you.

291
00:18:45,830 --> 00:18:47,430
Why did you refuse ?

292
00:18:49,680 --> 00:18:51,510
I have secretly spied on her

293
00:18:51,400 --> 00:18:53,030
and she is gorgeous !

294
00:18:55,200 --> 00:18:56,640
Uncle has a wife.

295
00:18:57,860 --> 00:18:58,820
Really ?

296
00:18:59,320 --> 00:19:02,230
How come I have never seen her ?

297
00:19:01,990 --> 00:19:03,990
She's waiting for me in a far away place.

298
00:19:04,320 --> 00:19:05,710
One day,

299
00:19:05,950 --> 00:19:07,410
I'll go back to her.

300
00:19:14,290 --> 00:19:15,370
Wow !

301
00:19:15,840 --> 00:19:17,810
She's so pretty.

302
00:19:42,560 --> 00:19:46,690
I've had my share of wounds,

303
00:19:44,600 --> 00:19:46,690
now I want to fight back.

304
00:19:46,520 --> 00:19:50,250
Is my destiny a wall of restrictions

305
00:19:50,080 --> 00:19:56,170
that's blocking all my hopes

306
00:19:52,960 --> 00:19:56,170
for life ?

307
00:19:57,720 --> 00:20:01,930
My flesh and blood witnessed the past,

308
00:19:59,440 --> 00:20:01,930
my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.

309
00:20:02,000 --> 00:20:05,330
How do you navigate through the years passing by ?

310
00:20:05,440 --> 00:20:11,330
Nirvana and rebirth are no longer

311
00:20:08,160 --> 00:20:11,330
out of reach.

312
00:20:12,440 --> 00:20:16,810
Immortals

313
00:20:13,480 --> 00:20:16,810
are obsessed with delusions of grandeur.

314
00:20:16,840 --> 00:20:20,850
Renegades

315
00:20:17,600 --> 00:20:20,850
seek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.

316
00:20:20,600 --> 00:20:24,690
Don't tell me that I overestimate myself

317
00:20:22,550 --> 00:20:24,690
and that the path to revenge leads to hell

318
00:20:24,680 --> 00:20:28,810
because I don't see the harm in that.

319
00:20:30,560 --> 00:20:36,610
My new body opens its eyes

320
00:20:33,080 --> 00:20:36,610
and awakens from its dream.

321
00:20:36,480 --> 00:20:44,170
I have overcome many trials

322
00:20:38,600 --> 00:20:44,170
to get this body back.

323
00:20:44,120 --> 00:20:51,810
No matter how many endless dark nights go by,

324
00:20:48,160 --> 00:20:51,810
I can still see.

325
00:20:51,960 --> 00:21:01,170
By sticking to this thought, I will get it done

326
00:20:55,920 --> 00:21:01,170
by my own hands.

327
00:21:31,800 --> 00:21:38,010
Returning to my body opened my eyes,

328
00:21:34,520 --> 00:21:38,010
I need to continue my Immortal journey.

329
00:21:37,760 --> 00:21:45,570
With a flick of a finger,

330
00:21:39,200 --> 00:21:45,570
only my indomitable heart remains.

331
00:21:45,360 --> 00:21:54,970
Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.

332
00:21:51,320 --> 00:21:54,970
Even if there are countless tribulations and hardships.

333
00:21:54,960 --> 00:22:02,810
Overcome this fate, smash through the obstacles,

334
00:21:57,480 --> 00:22:02,810
like the descent of a god.
